What is KYC Verification Service?
KYC (Know Your Customer) Verification Services encompass a suite of digital solutions designed to authenticate customer identities and mitigate fraud risks for businesses. These services combine document verification (passports, driver's licenses), biometric authentication (facial recognition, fingerprint scanning), and database checks against global watchlists. As financial regulations tighten worldwide, robust KYC processes have transitioned from being compliance requirements to strategic business imperatives that safeguard operations while enabling seamless customer onboarding.
